    <!-- Literal text that begins with '#'. resolve_consts() treats a leading
         '#' as a const reference on EVERY attribute, and only lets a value
         through unchanged when it is exactly 6 hex digits (is_hex_color), so
         placeholder_text="#RRGGBB" was looked up as a const, missed, and the
         attribute was dropped — the hex field showed no hint at all. A const's
